 "html": "<p>Did you know that FreeAgent have a mobile app? This makes life even easier for you as you can do your accounts on the go.</p><p>Here are some videos with more in-depth information:</p><p>1. <a href=\"https://app.salesforceiq.com/r?target=5ee39bd44cedfd007c1d70c8&amp;t=AFwhZf1oRPdWblb578cwRkDqRYKB90GS7mlepJbFpAh-VOmiNUViglo4NXKVLEjPINvYPwV2dcFFVWsnCXwF9YEWga0tJw366MhwEPFbHr9GlyAH4q471RuJYvIpcwUIpUu0dvQX9yMg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreeagent.wistia.com%2Fmedias%2Fuweauabgk1\" rel=\"noopener\">Introduction to FreeAgent Mobile</a></p><p>2. <a href=\"https://app.salesforceiq.com/r?target=5ee39bd54cedfd007c1d70c9&amp;t=AFwhZf1oRPdWblb578cwRkDqRYKB90GS7mlepJbFpAh-VOmiNUViglo4NXKVLEjPINvYPwV2dcFFVWsnCXwF9YEWga0tJw366MhwEPFbHr9GlyAH4q471RuJYvIpcwUIpUu0dvQX9yMg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreeagent.wistia.com%2Fmedias%2Fro94iysrko\" rel=\"noopener\">Understanding your FreeAgent Mobile dashboard</a></p><p>3. <a href=\"https://app.salesforceiq.com/r?target=5ee39bd54cedfd007c1d70cb&amp;t=AFwhZf1oRPdWblb578cwRkDqRYKB90GS7mlepJbFpAh-VOmiNUViglo4NXKVLEjPINvYPwV2dcFFVWsnCXwF9YEWga0tJw366MhwEPFbHr9GlyAH4q471RuJYvIpcwUIpUu0dvQX9yMg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreeagent.wistia.com%2Fmedias%2Fk0b79znvyv\" rel=\"noopener\">Create an expense with the FreeAgent app</a></p><p>4. <a href=\"https://app.salesforceiq.com/r?target=5ee39bd54cedfd007c1d70cc&amp;t=AFwhZf1oRPdWblb578cwRkDqRYKB90GS7mlepJbFpAh-VOmiNUViglo4NXKVLEjPINvYPwV2dcFFVWsnCXwF9YEWga0tJw366MhwEPFbHr9GlyAH4q471RuJYvIpcwUIpUu0dvQX9yMg&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Ffreeagent.wistia.com%2Fmedias%2Fnxb6mkdgf0\" rel=\"noopener\">Create an invoice with FreeAgent Mobile</a></p><p>And here is a visual reminder of why it is such a powerful tool:</p><figure><img src=\"/blog/454878_acded8be277a46eb8593cde97732925e~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/blog/454878_333daefac6c8488796e05f5931564969~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/blog/454878_76124e9d31a64e59bd7472ca62083b44~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/blog/454878_ff8c7e2fa97e4f538fe9e5fd7d254d6f~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/blog/454878_e9e52dac84414dcc920fd49377c0dddc~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><figure><img src=\"/blog/454878_8db48f04d0cd4b22a72929864b8620cc~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><p>As always, if you have any questions about this or would like our help setting it up, just <strong>contact us </strong>and we'll be glad to help.</p>"
